  "body": "What: Read a CSV cut list. Each row gives a part name or sketch, a quantity, a material and thickness, and a grain flag. The import fills the nest part list.\n\nWhy: Cabinet workflows start from a cut list. Cabinet CAM products load the list into the nest (Thermwood nesting loads parts with job and cabinet quantities). #2163 lists parts by selection only.\n\nSources: https://www.thermwood.com/updates_control_nesting_home.htm\n\nPart of #2395. Builds on #2160, #2163. Needs #2398 first (grain field).\n\nDone means: a decision comment fixes the CSV columns, and a test imports a list and fills the nest part list with the right counts, or refuses a bad row by name.\n\n",
